  "title": "· New Bag | CHANEL Unveils Fall/Winter 2026 Haute Couture: Gabrielle and the Magic Bean ·",
  "original_title": "新包 | CHANEL 发布2026秋冬高级定制服系列：嘉柏丽尔与魔豆",
  "excerpt": "Chanel's Fall/Winter 2026 show blends fairy tale motifs with classic silhouettes, balancing everyday wearability and couture dreaminess.",
