      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Chanel Fall/Winter 2026 Haute Couture show has just concluded at the Grand Palais in Paris. This season, the collection is titled \"Gaby and the Beanstalk,\" with creative director Matthieu Blazy drawing inspiration from a fairy tale anthology found in founder Gabrielle Chanel's personal library. Elements like magic beans, vines, teddy bears, the ugly duckling, and swans are woven into the house's classic silhouettes. Low-rise waists, gold and silver embellishments, and lightweight fabrics breathe life into the garments, striking a balance between everyday wearability and couture dreaminess.",
