      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This season's evening bags bring fairy tales to life. The magic bean from 'Jack and the Beanstalk' appears with metal-embellished leaves and curling vine chains. One version is adorned with red and white enamel, another with a green metallic finish, while pearl pods and a专属 vine metal stand complete the look.",
