    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The goose that laid the golden eggs is transformed into a delicate hard-shell evening bag, complete with turquoise eyes, a 'golden egg' pendant, and a 'nest' stand. The chain features metal feather details, and the wings open to store small items like jewelry or keys. Available in red-gold and silver colorways.",
